{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Gnawer No. 44 Observation Report",
    "steam_appid": 3314300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314300/extras/4286cd631796d093357586f081bc4e5f.avif?t=1754927026\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a 1990s filled with mystery and the unknown, a little-known private laboratory operates discreetly in a secluded corner of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;He&quot; trembled with fear, fleeing desperately. In a panic, &quot;he&quot; stumbled into a somewhat dilapidated and aged villa on the outskirts of the city. At first glance, the villa was shrouded by towering trees, their leaves rustling in the wind, while the birdsong in the forest seemed to whisper countless secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game, you will play as the protagonist, &quot;Andrade,&quot; who is assigned to live in this villa due to &quot;special&quot; work requirements. By chance, you will end up spending day and night with &quot;him&quot; in the attic, sharing many interesting days together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314300/extras/0a3c46a2eba2e5a081941073f18e5cde.avif?t=1754927026\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can feed &quot;him&quot; different foods, teach &quot;him&quot; daily life behaviors, record the ever-changing growth data, and more, immersing yourself in the joy of nurturing.<br>Will &quot;he&quot; become a ruthless money-making machine?<br>A close life companion?<br>A reliable comrade-in-arms ready to fight by your side?<br>...<br>Anything is possible!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314300/extras/7603459398f53ba4abc7284cc4741a75.avif?t=1754927026\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently features 14 different endings, completely distinct branching storylines, and unique nurturing mini-dramas at each stage, offering you a taste of multiple lives! Every choice you make will alter your destiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you lead a life of happiness or plunge into the abyss of despair? Everything hinges on your decisions!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314300/extras/4286cd631796d093357586f081bc4e5f.avif?t=1754927026\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a 1990s filled with mystery and the unknown, a little-known private laboratory operates discreetly in a secluded corner of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;He&quot; trembled with fear, fleeing desperately. In a panic, &quot;he&quot; stumbled into a somewhat dilapidated and aged villa on the outskirts of the city. At first glance, the villa was shrouded by towering trees, their leaves rustling in the wind, while the birdsong in the forest seemed to whisper countless secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the game, you will play as the protagonist, &quot;Andrade,&quot; who is assigned to live in this villa due to &quot;special&quot; work requirements. By chance, you will end up spending day and night with &quot;him&quot; in the attic, sharing many interesting days together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314300/extras/0a3c46a2eba2e5a081941073f18e5cde.avif?t=1754927026\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can feed &quot;him&quot; different foods, teach &quot;him&quot; daily life behaviors, record the ever-changing growth data, and more, immersing yourself in the joy of nurturing.<br>Will &quot;he&quot; become a ruthless money-making machine?<br>A close life companion?<br>A reliable comrade-in-arms ready to fight by your side?<br>...<br>Anything is possible!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314300/extras/7603459398f53ba4abc7284cc4741a75.avif?t=1754927026\" width=614 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently features 14 different endings, completely distinct branching storylines, and unique nurturing mini-dramas at each stage, offering you a taste of multiple lives! Every choice you make will alter your destiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you lead a life of happiness or plunge into the abyss of despair? Everything hinges on your decisions!</p>",
    "short_description": "Due to &quot;special&quot; work requirements, you've been assigned by your superiors to live in a very remote and desolate villa. You thought your dull and monotonous life would just carry on as usual, but every midnight, strange sounds emanate from the pitch-black attic...What kind of beginning awaits you?",
